<description>&lt;p&gt;The junta carried out a drone strike that damaged a Chinese gas pipeline facility, while Chinese courts sentenced three Myanmar scam gang members to death. Drone attacks hit Naga villages in Myanmar, prompting condemnation from NSF and NSCN-IM. The military continued its shadow banking expansion, hosted a delegation in Sri Lanka, and intensified airstrikes on a historic Buddhist meditation centre, a monastery, villages in Sagaing and displacement camps in Rakhine, killing civilians. The conflict caused 2,332 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxNQTVpZE5UV1AyRTlYMkZQSEdEVjRDR3RmQzQ4YjdESm1EQkZDSjJYVGxRZ0VPNXAtQkxQSXRSUndtTmoyTEZaWnBiYXU0NXdVbFZ2ZzItOFBFcDktX1dpM0Uta2VxUTB6WWZJN2I0V2xyMmZJQ1JvM01CY29IUUhoZFRYaC13N2h0bWF1MHVjWTNZWDZONWNvMjM1WDVLa2M?oc=5&quot;&gt;Tamil Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxPVmxzZS1MalRNRE5OOW9wVHVtMEROTWFHdHQ0SnZpOEJaRTNCVmVaZkxaTlI4RzdENTg5OWhEMUtNNjI5b18tQWNjQ2prcjc1YVdIQ3FTS01FUVRpWVV4OGJZR2lka1puem82a0t6NWlRYVBUM2F5czRwTmFYTXVLT2U1SFNvZUd0NlAxRGZPZEJPSDN0MWlmNmJrNGFGUFlQS0g4Y1J2aWJyUk1ORlJrdXJsWTVqby1lWXhWYQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sri Lanka Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxNMzkzT0s5ZXp3d0d0ZmRSUkx1VG1mUmhfdU5jUVQ2UU0waVZuLVRVVGRiT2JwekpzRDBqX0p6bDdvM2FKdTVGRU5HSkZyc2hDdDRXbUJaajdYcGk5Uk1aaUxTRVlLX1lYNjExTEpDdzVrTFdsRGtxLUJ1NGZoRHBoNTRIQ1lTX191aUx6RXU2amI4cWduSEh3YUlUQldJVW44?oc=5&quot;&gt;Tamil Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE81cUwzVENRMVE0LTFSc1BCcXZ5UHZaZ09Ya18xYlhyY0w4TmNkQXlMSHdidE5PbzhuZUZ6VWs3eGNxckdTSzk5UzFwRUZIaUtVdHV1clN1REVXQ1hMOXc?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;